{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e2f3fe1169bf6fe0cae9c5c6e65d016094587d10057db11b916482d2d7b7b778","ja":"悲しい神話","zh":"悲伤的神话","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b165498a887103e355b94e8ca817f016dea534d60f836a288ac92bd0986886e6","ja":"みんな、驚かせてごめんねぇ。こと座の神話を\n思い出したら、悲しい気持ちになってしまって……。","zh":"大家，吓到你们真是不好意思呢。我想起了\n天琴座的神话，不由得感到有些悲伤……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"53cd87e22a4919146de7a3cc6179aa6deb0d677b1b15426df40b360ddd79208f","ja":"確か、最後の最後で決まりをやぶって、\n奥さんと一生会えなくなっちゃうお話だったわよね？","zh":"我记得故事是讲在最后的最后违背了约定，\n导致再也无法和妻子相见了吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cb671c1ed2d4019f38160f9b36cbe325fa6dc24c7a0f581bfd0552c2d00517d6","ja":"神話には、悲しい一面もあります。……だからこそ、\n星々の輝きはあんなにも儚いのかもしれませんね～。","zh":"神话中，也有悲伤的一面。……正因如此，\n群星的光芒才会显得那样虚幻飘渺吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"742c0bf85ae397063ba50007564b15dfb7df7f83a18d3ca883c29aac5306c35c","ja":"うん……でも、おかげで、台本の練習も\nうまくできなくなってしまってね……。","zh":"嗯……不过，也多亏了这样，连台词的练习\n都没法顺利进行了呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4da67a6661bd08d29d516e04dac04dc8cdaa807d60deb4b66ee7a1d835698372","ja":"「オルフェウスは、美しい妖精エウリュディケと\n結婚します。ですが、エウリュディケは……」","zh":"“俄耳甫斯与美丽的妖精欧律狄刻\n结为了夫妻。然而，欧律狄刻却……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f21d7cc25bc340d696dbb03bd8124198c935f69c5f0678b2918b5c0186f5f54c","ja":"「え、エウリュディケは……」……うぅ。","zh":"“欧、欧律狄刻是……”……呜呜。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1609bbb03214a4c3a205de13f8f0d8270c739c01059e65a776e7f6e0cd17cdba","ja":"木下さん……！\nあの、どうしたら……。","zh":"木下同学……！\n那个，该怎么办才好……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7e411efb33f4531b08c8fef88ba9ae5a036c4c72b3927b5b7561c6d319ce322d","ja":"ナレーションを始めると、悲しい気持ちが\n溢れてしまうのですね……。","zh":"一念起旁白，悲伤的心情\n就会满溢出来呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ee7d8238172b120ef4dc88ad143820b5d58f35e4b27ef5edeea6c02316e0f83b","ja":"途中で涙声になっちゃうナレーションなんて、\nおかしいよねぇ……。","zh":"旁白中途带上了哭腔什么的，\n很奇怪吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6cb3f5f474ad954f1b8c81e0ff5e4be9379848c2f5b4fbb7c8de57e449b03225","ja":"……そうでしょうか～？　いろんな\nナレーションがあってもいいと思いますよ～？","zh":"……是这样吗～？我觉得也可以有\n各种各样的旁白哦～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"7e7bdfb7d088ad584636c9f13c71e9715017114b2d8793900b508bbdd2ac32bc","ja":"そうね……。ひなたちゃんのオリジナルナレーション\nなんだから、アリなんじゃないかしら♪","zh":"也是呢……。毕竟是日向的独家旁白，\n我觉得挺好的呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"b3fe56b16936d14785c9031d5a36fd092a9ec41f2c8db44b5e43939fa32e084b","ja":"えっ、でも……聞きづらいとお客さんも\n困っちゃうんじゃないかい……！？","zh":"诶，但是……听不清楚的话，客人也会\n很为难的吧……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1234.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"90471cafb404c6012e44eed26383713d5f20ec3959ef0687ce6cecd458e25bd9","ja":"大丈夫ですよ～。お話を伝える上で、とても大事な……\nひなたちゃんの気持ちが、きっと届きますから～。","zh":"没关系的～。在讲述故事时最重要的……\n日向的心意，一定能够传达到的～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
